  <p id="c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAACB">矩</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0002" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAACB">延明</persName>。拜世子，為屯騎校尉，與父<persName id="c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0017" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC">亮</persName>同被害。追贈典軍將軍，諡懷王。子<persName id="c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034" ref="2pi_e3t_aia">祐</persName>立，是為威王。</p>
</text>
